<title>USA: Omaha hogs up $1.25-1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up $1.25-1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.25 to $1.50 higher. Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs    52.25 to mostly 52.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    260-280 lbs    51.50-52.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    350-450 lbs    44.00</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    500-600 lbs    50.50-52.00</p>
</text>
